WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:02,300
Check it

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,320
Brother He, open the fire and eat

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,320
Really mutton

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,120
Otherwise, you would have worked for a long time just to watch me eat.

5
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,140
This is much more fragrant than the rabbit roasted at our camp

6
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,340
The key is to go to the mountains, heat and salt

7
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,140
Ingredients don’t just have to be caught

8
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,740
So having resources and being able to use them are two different things.

9
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:23,940
Say one more thing before eating

10
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,140
The reward for each of you today is this meal

11
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:27,540
The gourd is also considered as a home meal

12
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:28,740
Let’s clarify the rules first

13
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,740
After I finished eating, I asked if I could take the whole leg of lamb away with me.

14
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:31,940
Just say it up front

15
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,740
At least we won’t change the price temporarily after the work is done.

16
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:40,590
I finally had something that tasted like a normal meal.
